      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اظعنهُ</span></b>  <i>He made him to journey, go away,
depart,</i> (S, Msb, K,) or <i>remove;</i> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَعَنَ</span></b> 
signifies the same [or <i>he journeyed,</i> &amp;c., <i>with
him</i>]. (Msb.)

